  "description": "<p>Self; <strong>1 round per level</strong> (concentration).</p><ul><li>You become <strong>Invisible</strong> and an illusory double of you appears where you stood.</li><li>Directing the double needs no action: it moves at your speed, speaks and gestures as you wish, but cannot attack or cast, and vanishes if struck.</li><li>Your Invisibility ends if you attack or cast; the double stays.</li><li>A creature that studies the double makes a <strong>Will save</strong>; success sees through it.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Wizard, Illusionist, Bard</p>",
